{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_005_1000_p", "source_sha256": "773e0b7845170ecfd9d5e9f12f697da4f6a8585cde58ad5a723388effd4c17e4", "ja": "（次の公演で、静香のソロステージが決まった。\n打ち合わせのために、静香を探してるんだが……）", "zh": "（下次公演中，确定会有静香的个人演出了。\n我正在四处找她，想跟她商量表演的事宜……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_005_1001_se", "source_sha256": "3b4b0dce73f143e46345cb8bd6ee3af5af21d057dab5df6f79418334a527d984", "ja": "ポロン……ポロンポロン……♪", "zh": "（钢琴声……♪）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_005_1002_p", "source_sha256": "0c6833bffe3bc0c5be9f34c0d161d05f5dcae71a96e270407ad64de5ece1f2e3", "ja": "（この音は……ピアノ？\nレッスンルームから聞こえてるのか……？）", "zh": "（这个声音是……钢琴？\n是从练习室传来的吗……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_005_1003_015siz", "source_sha256": "30e0be2eb3daa9876cab5dc505b148bfb61402df1f875bc3df0c44ec09de0dbc", "ja": "……よし。\n久しぶりに弾いたけど、腕は鈍ってないみたいね。", "zh": "不错……虽然很久没弹了，\n但看来技巧没有生疏呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_005_1004_p", "source_sha256": "caa37f4c146efd39e5521d2c24529619ebc76c2bbb8875c44aa99a9bb59d2ad7", "ja": "静香、ここにいたんだな。\n今ピアノを弾いてたのは、静香か？", "zh": "静香，你在这里啊。\n刚才是你在弹钢琴吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_005_1005_015siz", "source_sha256": "3a36bcfdd4314d74aca948d4c29c55093ad826ce9db297410914b3b59bb8353d", "ja": "えっ……{$P$}！？\nい、いつから見てたんですか？", "zh": "咦……{$P$}！？\n你、你从什么时候开始看的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_005_1006_p", "source_sha256": "2311e95e8cdc61445e22c550af7dd37a3cb8a6862d81763e8556aef9ce64fa4f", "ja": "いや、今来たところだよ。\nそれにしても、上手いんだな。", "zh": "呃，我才刚来而已。\n话说回来，你的琴艺真厉害呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_005_1007_p", "source_sha256": "12742a17ce8967ac537112b7eb023fc7524b14b926d309e2c0e71ec690750463", "ja": "次の公演のソロステージ、\nピアノで弾き語りをするのも悪くないんじゃないか？", "zh": "你在下次公演的个人演出，\n用钢琴自弹自唱好像也不错哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_005_1008_015siz", "source_sha256": "a5726d946b11eee7e8d994c561c83beb36e99dc49af402fa3164dc53cc11b2fe", "ja": "なっ……そ、そんな簡単に言わないでください！\n自分の曲を弾きながら歌うなんて、そんなこと……。", "zh": "什……不、不要说得那么简单好吗！\n要边弹边唱自己的歌，哪那么容易……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_005_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "312626d8846c2bdb53533a209027eaaad764142db2dd14bc36ed65b73c8760ed", "ja": "そ、そんな風に軽々しく言わないでください！\nほんと、無責任なんだから……。", "zh": "请、请你不要这样随随便便就提出来！\n真是不负责任……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_005_1010_p", "source_sha256": "b870900e3aeb301938ad0cc8a8d4a46686e60ea886633a70a010e3fe08feb77d", "ja": "ご、ごめん。でもあんなに上手いんだし、\nいけると思ったんだけどな……。", "zh": "抱、抱歉。但我真的觉得你弹得很棒，\n是足以上台演出的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_005_1011_015siz", "source_sha256": "771182ba06def0230197abff8d3eeba91e89012c35e22a614f037e0ea6f99791", "ja": "べ、別に……あれくらい、普通です。\n小さい時から習っていれば、誰でも弾けます。", "zh": "才、才没有……这种水准很一般。\n只要从小开始学，谁都弹得出来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_005_1012_p", "source_sha256": "13cb00beb6034a61be328863db14b7ca10d9973becf68de7a52d3209b7ad4c62", "ja": "そういうものなのか……。\n静香も、ピアノは小さい頃から習ってたのか？", "zh": "原来是这样……\n静香也是从小就学钢琴吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_005_1013_015siz", "source_sha256": "e1a44f342d0e78d5d5e12de6123336bbb151d6d987fb9218f03489f15c3ab982", "ja": "ええ、まあ……。", "zh": "嗯，是的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_005_1014_p", "source_sha256": "db67d8756b6834ceaa0140dae4600f2e7d6f8d5986694d9b7d9ca79f3ee40cb7", "ja": "そうか。今でも続いてるっていう事は、\n静香はピアノが好きなんだな。", "zh": "原来如此，你现在也还在弹，\n表示你很喜欢钢琴吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_005_1015_015siz", "source_sha256": "2124a1db68aa26715f63e67de2b87388a889ad50dde5530b7e8c2263c6e500b7", "ja": "そうですね……今は好きです。", "zh": "对啊……我现在是喜欢的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_005_1016_p", "source_sha256": "e2024eb25e0b993654a899be939d7d0dda192837144e671b9d7bb6bca3aa70bb", "ja": "今は？", "zh": "现在？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_005_1017_015siz", "source_sha256": "028ce8b6c14012c8ab98b81e3483354df67e0c32ea3e8640b4bb56ee47aa4aff", "ja": "始めたばかりの頃は、いやでいやで仕方なかったので。\nレッスンがあるから、友達とは遊べなくなるし……。", "zh": "刚开始学的时候，我其实是相当不情愿的。\n因为去上钢琴课，就不能跟朋友一起玩了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_005_1018_015siz", "source_sha256": "c17c1c347c03b38b81fef0d8b9950c8c148ed91ca9211db6cc6b34271401f679", "ja": "ピアノなんて……音楽なんて、将来なんの\n役に立つんだろうって。ずっと思ってました。", "zh": "我当时一直认为……什么钢琴啊音乐的，\n对将来不会有助益……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_005_1019_p", "source_sha256": "565c504430503e78821e8a25255e2fe441f70eb0ec21ddacbdb227d7474acedb", "ja": "そうだったのか……。\n途中でやめようとは思わなかったのか？", "zh": "这样啊……\n那你中间都没想过要放弃吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_005_1020_015siz", "source_sha256": "4440d6d3de92f44e7e5d41da2c7c7a92f36ba835a40ac7e93bfdc40e90c31097", "ja": "何度も思いました。……でも、TVであるアイドルを\n観てから、その考えが変わったんです。", "zh": "想过好几次了……可是，自从我在电视上\n看到某位偶像以后，我就改观了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_005_1021_015siz", "source_sha256": "b1a2d735a41114f5447f3166c84df141d760a8780162184407d50113c0c480f9", "ja": "その人が、本当に楽しそうに歌っていて……。\n気づいたら私も歌っていました。", "zh": "那个人唱歌时看起来真的很开心……\n一不留神，我也跟着她唱了起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_005_1022_p", "source_sha256": "f57ddd602ef9fee6d390186f61be2cfaf47b4c33b5399d068926a3994dc478d2", "ja": "アイドルが……。", "zh": "是偶像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_005_1023_015siz", "source_sha256": "0b5d0068f24441bc3fd7b5c2019d5458f329613dee454a8a9419bc38d7a3db0e", "ja": "その時、気づいたんです。音楽はこんなふうに、\n人を幸せな気持ちにできる素晴らしいものなんだって。", "zh": "当时我才惊觉，原来音乐是如此美妙的事物，\n能够让人感到幸福。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_005_1024_015siz", "source_sha256": "7cb616c2b77dd6df5a253835b6dbfbf72750a51b682e8bc8dcebc7b0158911bd", "ja": "……私も、あんなふうになりたいと思ったんです。", "zh": "……因此我才有了希望自己也能变成那样的想法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_005_1025_p", "source_sha256": "b0e855acf7c07620c5ccf9da253ab1d57fc5392daec554282d37537dde064fee", "ja": "なるほど。\nそれで静香は、アイドルを目指したわけか。", "zh": "原来如此，\n是因为这样，静香你才会想当偶像啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_005_1026_015siz", "source_sha256": "f6e1f8d5b3e11173a50f7811e41ef07ddf61ab0af258f267231e815962277059", "ja": "はい。ピアノも、それから好きになりました。\n音楽と触れ合える大切な機会なので……。", "zh": "是的，从那之后，我也爱上了钢琴，\n因为这是能跟音乐相处的珍贵机会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_005_1027_p", "source_sha256": "98992c8dd63acbbf9683cd66255913816b10828fcf446a5f1869237ed46316fe", "ja": "そして静香はアイドルになった……まさに有言実行だ。\nご両親も、喜んでるだろう？", "zh": "接着静香就成为了偶像……真的是说到做到呢。\n你的父母想必也很替你开心吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_005_1028_015siz", "source_sha256": "a252bd41bf98ad4eb0f50038dd6b89c29d2e9a7303eb7af329a77a5ce4240ea7", "ja": "……いえ。\n父は全く、アイドルに理解を示してくれていません。", "zh": "不……\n父亲丝毫不想了解偶像是什么样的存在。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_005_1029_015siz", "source_sha256": "66e5f150ea4e2f536eb80406a68b0b64fe55bb2c430aa7dd0791ca8748ddd065", "ja": "アイドルなんて、お遊びだって……最初は\nオーディションを受ける事も、反対されていました。", "zh": "他认为当偶像就只是在玩……\n起初也反对我去参加甄选。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_005_1030_015siz", "source_sha256": "04e18467d3c52176935ec5559465e2567517f257e8f0f8675e1c3f90c463d7c3", "ja": "でも、頼み込んで頼み込んで……ようやく、\n中学生の間だけという条件で許してもらえたんです。", "zh": "但在我千拜托万拜托之下……他终于点头，\n允许我只在国中时期从事偶像活动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_005_1031_p", "source_sha256": "edbec172a710a05c249652334b5f40c716f8667583452e11512bdccfd96bb06c", "ja": "……中学生の間だけ、だって？", "zh": "……你说只在国中时期？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_005_1032_015siz", "source_sha256": "06dd69ef53e432fb58c709c8bd408c7cbf4a250ccbe9d5cf1292d2be26100cd7", "ja": "高校に入ったら、アイドルは辞める……\nそういう約束なんです。", "zh": "升上高中以后就要放弃偶像身分……\n这是我跟他约好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_005_1033_p", "source_sha256": "ec6a9e9d2aeb38deb3ee6b76ed81f6fa07c1cb8925fc688a44d68ec5e618596c", "ja": "！\nそれは、本当なのか……？", "zh": "！\n这是真的吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_005_1034_015siz", "source_sha256": "7b303dff79f1ccee49d0bb6a06c586ffcca5d1ec3fa33d9abbc0dc4d74cc99fa", "ja": "はい。だから私は、結果を出さないといけないんです。\n父にアイドル活動を認めてもらえるような結果を……。", "zh": "是真的，所以我一定要做出成果才行，\n要做出足以让父亲认同偶像活动的成果……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_005_1035_015siz", "source_sha256": "1edbeca009aac30553ee81733bd7f8103b895f921a41fe8c9400c0d21aa00af6", "ja": "今度の公演のソロステージも、大切なその機会です。\n絶対に成功させないと……。", "zh": "这次公演的个人演出也是重要的机会之一，\n一定要让它成功才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_015siz_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_015siz_005_1036_015siz", "source_sha256": "b945cc3c38586c8286fd80842627ef542745500858eb7f618e64e829e69c1c4d", "ja": "だから……面白半分で、いい加減な\n弾き語りなんてしてる場合じゃないんです。", "zh": "所以……我不能带着半开玩笑的心情，\n表演那种半吊子的自弹自唱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
